{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048250/extras/a9f6f40efcffa4fd5a64d5252c2ac9a4.webp?t=1773206296\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sinister Witch has kidnapped your beloved Bing Bing. You must travel the sweeping lands of C\u00f3sta Cr\u00e9 and do what it takes to get your poochingus back from the Nightmare Realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048250/extras/f789464158527869fc0345cc63a7d287.webp?t=1773206296\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to learn a VAST variety of skills that will test the limits of your brittle boy body. Sliding, spinning and bouncing to name a few. Perhaps you'll discover ancient powers... who knows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048250/extras/3b3ed0609b2ead35394419b1d2ad748f.webp?t=1773206296\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is of the essence! Take your time if you like, but this will have severe consequences. The witch grows hungrier by the second!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048250/extras/8a0fd8db8c58e959dfedb594e0c7d283.webp?t=1773206296\" width=600 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many threats stalking you for a bite of your pretty little bowl cut. Don't get caught... Unless you like children getting ripped apart and stuff.\u00a0\u00af\\_(\u30c4)_/\u00af</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s